# B2B + B2C Platform — Progress Summary & Next Plan

## Completed Phases ✅

### P1: Role-Based Access & Subdomains
- Better Auth roles: `admin`, `shop_owner`, `consumer`, `salesman`, `deliveryman`
- Subdomain routing: `app.` (admin) vs `shop.` (shop owner dashboard)
- Route group layout isolation for shop owner dashboard

### P2: B2B Wholesale Ordering
- TRADE variant filtering for shop owners
- `orderType: "b2b"` tagging on orders
- Shop owner "My B2B Orders" page with status filter + pagination

### P3: Auto-Conversion (B2B → B2C Stock)
- Stock ledger with `CONVERT_OUT` / `CONVERT_IN` entries
- Admin stock deduction on conversion
- `linkedRetailVariantId` for trade→retail variant mapping

### P4: Pricing & Margin Control
- Shop owners can set retail prices on inventory
- `updateRetailPrice` enforces `price ≥ basePrice + margin` (percent or fixed)
- `minMarginPercent` + `minMarginAmount` on product variants

### P5: Seller Store Pages
- `/store` — area-based shop discovery with search
- `/store/[slug]` — individual shop storefront with "Add to Cart"

### P6: Consumer B2C Ordering
- `cartItem.shopId` — tracks which shop consumer is buying from
- `addToCart` uses shop's retail price when `shopId` provided
- `placeOrder` sets `order.shopId`, deducts shop inventory
- `getCart` returns `shopId`, `variantId`, `shopName` per item

### P7: Shop Owner B2C Order Management (just completed)
- `order.shopId` column + index for B2C order tracking
- `getIncomingOrders` — paginated list with status filter + order items + customer info
- `updateIncomingOrderStatus` — confirm/process/deliver/cancel
- Frontend: `/dashboard/incoming-orders` page with action buttons
- Sidebar: split into "Consumer Orders" + "My B2B Orders"

### Build Health Fixes (5 pre-existing errors)
- [Application](file:///c:/Users/Shorno/WebstormProjects/bikalpo-project/apps/web/app/%28dashboard%29/dashboard/admin/seller-applications/seller-applications-client.tsx#41-63) type dates, [DraftVariant](file:///c:/Users/Shorno/WebstormProjects/bikalpo-project/apps/web/components/features/product/components/variant-form-dialog.tsx#43-44) cast, `UserRole` cast, [CartItem](file:///c:/Users/Shorno/WebstormProjects/bikalpo-project/packages/db/src/schema/cart.ts#88-89) interfaces

